        {
          "text": " Ebala EJAKAIT loka aioresio ebe, Etolosi eoŋ ŋes, elomari ŋesi togo loka ekokolan, togo da loka ŋin yeniyapoi aiŋal elimit ekakiror: iboienenei togoke, emudiari ŋes ka akitoke ka amoruke da.”",
